            "phase": "Charge phase",
            "description": "<b>WHEN:</b> Your opponent’s Charge phase, just after an enemy unit ends a Charge move.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Adeptus Astartes Terminator, Bladeguard Veteran Squad, Sternguard Veteran Squad or Vanguard Veteran Squad unit from your army within Engagement Range of that enemy unit.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the turn, each time an attack is allocated to a model in your unit, subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of that attack.",
